  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CCFN Institutional Capacity Strengthening</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is part of the remodelling process within CAFOD.  The CAFOD Nigeria officer will be hosted by CCFN (the national Caritas).  Therefore this project is designed to support the institutional capacity of CCFN to host CAFOD&apos;s office in Nigeria and also to support the profile raising of CCFN.
 
In the financial year 13/14 the hosting costs include support to vehicle, facility and support costs to CAFOD&apos;s programme officer</narrative>
  </description>
